{"page":180,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:26","surah":8,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟ إِذْ أَنتُمْ قَلِيلٌ مُّسْتَضْعَفُونَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ تَخَافُونَ أَن يَتَخَطَّفَكُمُ ٱلنَّاسُ فَـَٔاوَىٰكُمْ وَأَيَّدَكُم بِنَصْرِهِۦ وَرَزَقَكُم مِّنَ ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember when you were few, victimized in the land, afraid that people might catch you, but God sheltered you and strengthened you with His help, and provided you with good things so that you might be grateful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَلِيلٌۭ","en_gloss":"(were) few","transliteration":"qalīlun","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُّسْتَضْعَفُونَ","en_gloss":"(and) deemed weak","transliteration":"mus'taḍʿafūna","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَخَافُونَ","en_gloss":"fearing","transliteration":"takhāfūna","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَتَخَطَّفَكُمُ","en_gloss":"might do away with you","transliteration":"yatakhaṭṭafakumu","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"the men","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَـَٔاوَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"then He sheltered you","transliteration":"faāwākum","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَيَّدَكُم","en_gloss":"and strengthened you","transliteration":"wa-ayyadakum","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِنَصْرِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with His help","transliteration":"binaṣrihi","verse_key":"8:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَرَزَقَكُم","en_gloss":"and provided you","tran