":"8:27"}]},{"verse_key":"8:28","surah":8,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّمَآ أَمْوَٰلُكُمْ وَأَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ فِتْنَةٌ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ عِندَهُۥٓ أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Be aware that your possessions and your children are only a test, and that there is a tremendous reward with God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And know","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"annamā","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your wealth","transliteration":"amwālukum","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your children","transliteration":"wa-awlādukum","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِتْنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a trial","transliteration":"fit'natun","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عِندَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"with Him","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَجْرٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a reward","transliteration":"ajrun","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"8:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:28"}]},{"verse_key":"8:29","surah":8,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِن تَتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ يَجْعَل لَّكُمْ فُرْقَانًا وَيُكَفِّرْ عَنكُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتِكُمْ وَيَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, if you remain mindful of God, He will give you a criterion [to tell right from wrong] and wipe out your bad deeds, and forgive you: God’s favour is great indeed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"8:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"a