y schemed and so did God: He is the best of schemers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَمْكُرُ","en_gloss":"plotted","transliteration":"yamkuru","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِكَ","en_gloss":"against you","transliteration":"bika","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِيُثْبِتُوكَ","en_gloss":"that they restrain you","transliteration":"liyuth'bitūka","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَقْتُلُوكَ","en_gloss":"kill you","transliteration":"yaqtulūka","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُخْرِجُوكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"drive you out","transliteration":"yukh'rijūka","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَيَمْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":"And they were planning","transliteration":"wayamkurūna","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَيَمْكُرُ","en_gloss":"and (also) was planning","transliteration":"wayamkuru","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":15,"ar":"خَيْرُ","en_gloss":"is (the) Best","transliteration":"khayru","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْمَـٰكِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the Planners","transliteration":"l-mākirīna","verse_key":"8:30"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:30"}]},{"verse_key":"8:31","surah":8,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتُنَا قَالُوا۟ قَدْ سَمِعْنَا لَوْ نَشَآءُ لَقُلْنَا مِثْلَ هَـٰذَآ ۙ إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّآ أَسَـٰطِيرُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whenever Our Revelation is recited to them they say, ‘We have heard all this before- we could say something like this if we wanted- this is nothing but ancient fables.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"are recited","transliteration":"tut'lā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"āyātunā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَمِعْنَا","en_gloss":"we have heard","transliteration":"samiʿ'nā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"we wish","transliteration":"nashāu","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَقُلْنَا","en_gloss":"surely, we could say","transliteration":"laqul'nā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِثْلَ","en_gloss":"like","transliteration":"mith'la","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ ۙ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"is this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَسَـٰطِيرُ","en_gloss":"tales","transliteration":"asāṭīru","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the former (people)","transliteration":"l-awalīna","verse_key":"8:31"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:31"}]},{"verse_key":"8:32","surah":8,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالُوا۟ ٱللَّهُمَّ إِن كَانَ هَـٰذَا هُوَ ٱلْحَقَّ مِنْ عِندِكَ فَأَمْطِرْ عَلَيْنَا حِجَارَةً مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ أَوِ ٱئْتِنَا بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They also said, ‘God, if this really is the truth from You, then rain stones on us from the heavens, or send us some other painful punishment.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُمَّ","en_gloss":"O Allah","transliteration":"l-lahuma","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"[it]","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَقَّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِندِكَ","en_gloss":"from You","transliteration":"ʿindika","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَأَمْطِرْ","en_gloss":"then (send) rain","transliteration":"fa-amṭir","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"upon us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حِجَارَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(of) stones","transliteration":"ḥijāratan","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱئْتِنَا","en_gloss":"bring (upon) us","transliteration":"i'tinā","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بِعَذَابٍ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"biʿadhābin","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَلِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmin","verse_key":"8:32"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:32"}]},{"verse_key":"8:33","surah":8,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كَانَ ٱللَّهُ لِيُعَذِّبَهُمْ وَأَنتَ فِيهِمْ ۚ وَمَا كَانَ ٱللَّهُ مُعَذِّبَهُمْ وَهُمْ يَسْتَغْفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But God would not send them punishment while you [Prophet] are in their midst, nor would He punish them if they sought forgiveness,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"But not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(for) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِيُعَذِّبَهُمْ","en_gloss":"that He punishes them","transliteration":"liyuʿadhibahum","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَنتَ","en_gloss":"while you","transliteration":"wa-anta","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِيهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(are) among them","transliteration":"fīhim","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُعَذِّبَهُمْ","en_gloss":"the One Who punishes them","transliteration":"muʿadhibahum","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَسْتَغْفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"seek forgiveness","transliteration":"yastaghfirūna","verse_key":"8:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:33"}]}]}